  "configuration_id": "config_037",
  "reason": "The strongest completed experiments are multimodal scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l with multiprofile and transformer aggregation, with weighted fusion slightly better than concat in both accuracy and F1. RNA-only scvi results suggest avgpool and transformer aggregation are close, but this has not been tested in the multimodal setting. config_037 keeps the best-known encoders, multiprofile setting, and weighted fusion while changing only aggregation from transformer to avgpool. This isolates the aggregation effect in the currently best family, has high expected performance, and clarifies whether transformer aggregation is necessary or whether a simpler avgpool configuration is sufficient before exploring new encoders or profile settings."
}

